{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04346","headline":"谒汉世祖庙 · 刘希夷","name":"谒汉世祖庙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"舂陵气初发，渐台首未传。\n列营百万衆，持国十八年。\n运开朱旗後，道合赤符先。\n宛城劒鸣匣，昆阳镝应弦。\n犷兽血涂地，巨人声沸天。\n长驱过北赵，短兵出南燕。\n太守迎门外，王郎死道边。\n昇坛九城陌，端拱千秋年。\n朝廷方雀跃，劒佩几联翩。\n至德刑四海，神仪翳九泉。\n宗子行旧邑，恭闻清庙篇。\n君容穆而圣，臣像俨犹贤。\n攒木承危柱，疎萝挂朽椽。\n祠庭巢鸟啄，祭器网虫缘。\n怀古江山在，惟新历数迁。\n空余今夜月，长似旧时悬。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘希夷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04346.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04346","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}